{"spec":"<div id=\"post\">\n    <div class=\"tab\">\n        \n        <h1 class=\"setting\">設定狙い：設定判別</h1>\n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">まずはココを見ろ！</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">設定判別項目</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>確定演出</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 73%;\">項目</th>\n                            <th>重要度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">AT終了画面</td>\n                            <td>★★★☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">コナミコマンドでのボイス</td>\n                            <td>★★☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>共通</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 73%;\">項目</th>\n                            <th>重要度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">左1stベル確率</td>\n                            <td>★☆☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">ざっくり設定判別</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-01-09\" loading=\"lazy\">ツモった際のやめ時</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n          \n            <div class=\"left\">\n                \n                <h3>大まかな目安</h3>\n                <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-01-09\">2024/01/09更新</div>\n                <h4>やめ推奨時間</h4>\n                <p>閉店45分前の覚醒モード抜け、もしくは閉店30分前のAT後にやめ。</p>\n                <h4>閉店欠損度</h4>\n                <p>★☆☆☆☆</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>解説</h3>\n<p>純増が高い上に引き戻しモードと覚醒モードをループする高設定は\n    基本的にAT後、覚醒モード抜け、のどちらでやめてもあまり割に影響しないため、閉店時間ギリギリまで打ちましょう。</p>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">スペック</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>AT確率</h3>\n                <table>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 45%;\">設定</th>\n                            <th>AT初当り</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>1/246.8</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>1/236.3</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>1/223.9</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>1/208.9</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>1/172.9</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1/141.6</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>出玉率</h3>\n                <table>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 45%;\">設定</th>\n                            <th>出玉率</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>97.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>98.9%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>101.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>104.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>107.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>110.0